  <title xml:lang="EN">Support services for land use and mapping projects</title>
  <description xml:lang="EN">There is a need for expert services in support of preparation and follow-up of projects related to land use and mapping, in particular in the Mekong region. The National Land Survey has provided this expert support previously and the Asia and Oseania Unit would like to continue this collaboration in the framework of a 2-year agreement.</description>
